{"id":"n14322-1-4","stage":2,"title":"양보 · 让步","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14322-1-4-1","ko":"네가 언니니까 동생한테 양보 좀 해라.","zh":"你是姐姐，让着点比你小的孩子吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언니니까","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동생한테","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"양보","meaning":"让步","explanation":"양보：让步","readings":[{"term":"양보","audio":"/audio/411a0c36dc22cdfa22ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14322","senseId":"1","lemma":"양보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해라.","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"411a0c36dc22cdfa","term":"양보","zh":"让步","audio":"/audio/411a0c36dc22cdfa22ec.mp3","entryId":"14322","definition":"为他人腾出或让出位置或东西等。","pronunciation":["양ː보"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f46591f81f972c7a87f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14322-1-4-2","ko":"왜 자꾸 나한테만 그러세요?","zh":"为什么总是只要求我？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나한테만","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러세요?","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]}],"audio":"/audio/848a046b1babb0c03222.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14322","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["为什么总是只要求我？","你是姐姐，让着点比你小的孩子吧。","我有两个姐姐和一个弟弟。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你是姐姐，让着点比你小的孩子吧。","我有两个姐姐和一个弟弟。","为什么总是只要求我？"],"answer":2}]}
